Floramory — Backend Environment Reference
This project has no Node.js server. "Backend" = Supabase Edge Functions.
Edge Functions receive these variables automatically from Supabase runtime —
you do NOT need to set them manually unless running locally with supabase CLI.

--- Supabase Edge Function runtime variables (auto-injected by Supabase) ---
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key  ← NEVER share or commit this

--- For local Edge Function development with Supabase CLI ---
Run: supabase start
Then: supabase functions serve
CLI will inject the variables above automatically from supabase/config.toml

--- Deploy Edge Functions to production ---
supabase functions deploy send-preorder --project-ref YOUR_PROJECT_REF
supabase functions deploy admin --project-ref YOUR_PROJECT_REF
